{"id":"998812b396b09ca7","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-desc-projective-set.md","title":"ZFC Desc Projective Set","display":"df-zfc-desc-projective-set — ZFC Desc Projective Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-desc-projective-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-desc-projective-set"],"display":"df-zfc-desc-projective-set — ZFC Desc Projective Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-projective-level.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-desc-projective-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-desc-projective-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-desc-projective-set — ZFC Desc Projective Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d6520eb2e68d23c\" href=\"?note=9d6520eb2e68d23c\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-projective-level.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-projective-level.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,\\tau,n\\in V\">\\(A,X,\\tau,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\)</span> (Polish-space predicate inherited by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9d6520eb2e68d23c\" href=\"?note=9d6520eb2e68d23c\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-projective-level.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-projective-level.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1(X,\\tau),\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1(X,\\tau),\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topology-indexed boldface projective pointclasses from the same dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescProjectiveSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescProjectiveSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescProjectiveSet}_S(A,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1(X,\\tau)\\cup\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1(X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescProjectiveSet}_S(A,X,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1(X,\\tau)\\cup\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1(X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A level-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> projective set belongs to the boldface <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1\\)</span> pointclass induced by the supplied Polish topology.</li>\n<li>The topology argument is now carried by the pointclass itself, rather than being checked and then discarded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":